---
description: Repository agent rules — AGENTS.md is the single source of truth
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow @AGENTS.md before making any change in this repository. It is the authoritative rule set:

- SHA-pin every third-party action (`uses: owner/action@<40-char-sha> # vX.Y.Z`) — ADR 0005
- Conventional commits on every commit and PR title; clean history — ADR 0006
- Lint gates: `pre-commit run --all-files` and `bats tests/` must pass before committing
- Never create, move, or delete tags by hand; the workflow owns all tags — ADR 0003
- Never interpolate `${{ }}` into a workflow `run:` body; pass values via `env:`

Do not add rules to this file; add them to AGENTS.md so every tool sees the same guidance (ADR 0007).
